<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark"><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"><title>Somebody tried to make an account on tidy notebook at notes.example.com with your address</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;supported-color-schemes:light dark}
body{margin:0;padding:0;width:100%!important}a{text-decoration:underline}a:focus{outline:2px solid #1a63c4;outline-offset:3px}
@media(max-width:620px){.shell{padding:20px 12px!important}.card{padding:24px 20px!important}.brand-row{padding:0 4px 16px!important}.foot{padding:20px 4px!important}.button-table{width:100%!important}.button-link{display:block!important;text-align:center!important}}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.page{background-color:#141414!important}.card{background-color:#222222!important;border-color:#2e2e2e!important}.text,.url{color:#d0cfcc!important}.strong{color:#f5f4f2!important}.muted,.label{color:#a5a39e!important}.warning{color:#f5817d!important}.link{color:#6fa8f5!important}.tile,.button-cell{background-color:#ececea!important}.tile,.button-link{color:#141414!important}.panel{background-color:#2b2b2b!important}}
</style></head>
<body class="page" bgcolor="#f7f7f5" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f7f7f5">
<div aria-hidden="true" style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all">A new sign-up used your address. Your account has not changed.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="page" bgcolor="#f7f7f5" style="background-color:#f7f7f5;table-layout:fixed"><tr><td align="center" class="shell" style="padding:32px 12px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px;table-layout:fixed">
<tr><td class="brand-row" style="padding:0 4px 16px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td aria-hidden="true" class="tile" width="32" height="32" align="center" bgcolor="#1a1917" style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background-color:#1a1917;color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700">tn</td><td class="strong" style="padding-left:10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#191917">tidy notebook</td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:32px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e6e4e0;border-radius:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-wrap:break-word">
<p class="label" style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#67655f">Account notice</p>
<h1 class="strong" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:31px;font-weight:700;color:#191917">You already have an account</h1>
<p class="text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#37352f;">Somebody asked for a new account on tidy notebook at notes.example.com with this address. The address already has an account, so nothing changed.</p><p class="text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#37352f;">To sign in, open the sign-in page. If you do not know your password, select Forgot password on that page.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="button-table" style="margin:24px 0 0"><tr><td class="button-cell" align="center" bgcolor="#1a1917" style="background-color:#1a1917;border-radius:8px;mso-padding-alt:12px 22px"><a class="button-link" href="https://notes.example.com/login" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;mso-padding-alt:0">Sign in</a></td></tr></table>

<p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#67655f;margin:20px 0 4px;">If the link does not open, copy the address into your browser.</p>
<p class="url" style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#37352f;word-break:break-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><a class="link" href="https://notes.example.com/login" style="color:#1a63c4;text-decoration:underline">https://notes.example.com/login</a></p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 0;table-layout:fixed"><tr><td class="panel" bgcolor="#f0efec" style="padding:16px;border-radius:8px;background-color:#f0efec"><p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#67655f;margin:0;">If you asked for the account yourself, you already have one. Otherwise, ignore this message.</p></td></tr></table>
</td></tr><tr><td class="foot" style="padding:20px 4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">
<p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#67655f;margin:0 0 8px;">tidy notebook at notes.example.com</p><p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#67655f;margin:0 0 8px;">You get this message because a sign-up on tidy notebook at notes.example.com used the address of your existing account. This message is automatic.</p>
<p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#67655f;margin:0;">For help, contact your installation administrator.</p>
</td></tr></table><!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr></table></body></html>